    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A sigil appears at a point on the ground you can see within range, then erupts in a 20-foot-radius Sphere. Each creature in the Sphere makes a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure, it takes 5d6 Force damage, is pulled up to 10 feet straight toward the sigil, and has the &amp;Reference[restrained apply=false]{Restrained} condition until the end of your next turn. On a success, it takes half as much damage, and its Speed is reduced by 10 feet until the end of your next turn.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-FTV509afaxxPXI6X\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Remove the Speed reduction from the creatures that failed, which are Restrained.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
